==================================================
PART 3 — SECURITY CHECK
==================================================

Review security before packaging.

Check:
- No secrets are hardcoded
- No .env file is included in final zip
- .env.example exists
- Auth-protected routes are protected
- Student cannot access another student’s data
- Parent cannot access unlinked child data
- Academy partner cannot access other academy data
- Owner-only pages are protected
- Payment is not marked paid without verification/manual approval
- Upload validation exists
- Dangerous file types are blocked
- AI output does not auto-publish
- Audit log exists for important actions
- Cron endpoints are protected with secret token if implemented
- Firebase/AI/Ziina secrets are not exposed

Fix high-priority security issues before packaging.

